# tally 2.2.1 (the lead's pick P26 on the builder's STOP-REPORT), L §6.4: "nothing before it changes", and L §4.4 for a
# window across D: the scenario's decisions dx (window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03), across from 2026-05-01) and dy
# (window(2026-04-10, 2026-04-20), before it) read konto. dy books nothing; dx's hole starts at from: a balance on a
# day before from is the base's (d_apr, 750.00 PLN), after it the hole naming w (d_may), and pinned to 2026-05-02
# 850.00 PLN (d_pin). W4 holed konto from each window's first day (the builder's probe dfrom/).
=== base.tally
model cb
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input wa: date
input wb: date
input sp: month
input bank: observed
move pa: transfers
  on wa
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
move pb: transfers
  on wb
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  sp = 2026-03 "s"
  w = window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) "s"
  wa = window(2026-03-28, 2026-04-02) "s"
  wb = window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-05
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 640.00 PLN at 2026-03-20 end "saldo"
version fix
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-08
  anchor konto
  replace stated[konto] = 650.00 PLN at 2026-03-20 end "saldo, poprawione"
ask cnt: count(m in transfers over sp)
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over cb
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-01

input w2: date

move dx: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount if bal(konto) > 0 then amt else amt

move dy: transfers
  on w2
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount if bal(konto) > 0 then amt else amt

version vs
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w2 = window(2026-04-10, 2026-04-20) "s"

ask d_apr: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc
ask d_may: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask d_pin: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
=== expect d_apr d_may d_pin
d_apr: 750.00 PLN
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pa
  cut 2026-06-10
d_may: ?"date within window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) not precise enough for the day of dx" (dx)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pa
  cut 2026-06-10
d_pin: 850.00 PLN
  pinned: w = 2026-05-02
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: dx
  unfulfilled: pa
  cut 2026-06-10
